    "body": "Yep, I'm glad you raised this, darn Apple and Samsung. Every single other style looks beautiful and would look absolutely **_amazing_** with your proposed colour scheme within the Discord.\r\n_(With the purple/blue accents and such.)_\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/26250962/57671360-6738bc00-760b-11e9-960d-90ebd7dd39de.png)\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\nAs a potential solution, how would you feel about using SVGs to allow this to look awesome on MacOS/iOS clients as well as everywhere else? This will make the README look _flawless_ on every platform.\r\n\r\nHere's a rough preview using Twemoji.\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/26250962/57673059-9999e780-7612-11e9-86df-b263b5bde9ab.png)\r\n-----\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/26250962/57673051-89820800-7612-11e9-8f22-23c0207e584a.png)\r\n",
