    "created_at": "2019-05-14T06:01:22Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-05-14T06:01:22Z",
    "body": "> The :sparkles::rocket: pairing was meant to literally be \"star ship\"\r\n\r\nI would like to add that I didn't actually know this, heh. I was wondering why you used sparkles and assumed the sparkles were representing a faster engine/propulsion system of some kind. :smile: \r\n\r\nIt might've been more obvious if you used :star::rocket: _(The same two emojis that the Spaceship ZSH project uses)_ but knowing me, I probably wouldn't have gotten it anyway! ",
